{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Twisted Screens!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/Story.gif?t=1742581501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Twisted Screens</i> invites you to step into the shoes of Tessa, a mercenary hired by ATR Industries to explore an abandoned science facility overrun by horrific experiments. Partnering with the snarky A.I. assistant, Legsy, Tessa embarks on a journey to uncover the dark secrets behind this once-renowned company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Meet Legsy, your witty companion! This sarcastic A.I, created during ATR\u2019s prime, he will guide you through the facility, assisting with puzzles and providing humorous commentary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1742581501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this first-person sci-fi thriller, explore the haunting ATR facility, solve puzzles, and piece together the absurd lore of this bizarre world. Utilize gadgets and hazards to navigate challenges and fend off lurking enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/Insanity.gif?t=1742581501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Within ATR, nothing is as it seems. Monsters lurk, robots yap, and absurdity is the only rule that remains. Expect the unexpected\u2014because here, sanity is just another failed experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3008950?t=1742581501","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742581501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/c26391f4d85ead2cc0da39274e294ff3a9a64adf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742581501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/c26391f4d85ead2cc0da39274e294ff3a9a64adf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742581501","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Twisted Screens!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/Story.gif?t=1742581501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Twisted Screens</i> invites you to step into the shoes of Tessa, a mercenary hired by ATR Industries to explore an abandoned science facility overrun by horrific experiments. Partnering with the snarky A.I. assistant, Legsy, Tessa embarks on a journey to uncover the dark secrets behind this once-renowned company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Meet Legsy, your witty companion! This sarcastic A.I, created during ATR\u2019s prime, he will guide you through the facility, assisting with puzzles and providing humorous commentary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1742581501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this first-person sci-fi thriller, explore the haunting ATR facility, solve puzzles, and piece together the absurd lore of this bizarre world. Utilize gadgets and hazards to navigate challenges and fend off lurking enemies.